---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const updated = 'October 22, 2026';
const phone = '(623) 824-1326';
const phoneRaw = '6238241326';
const email = 'info@gogoglossaz.com';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Go Go Gloss"
  description="How Go Go Gloss LLC collects, uses, and protects your personal information, including our SMS/text messaging practices."
  canonical="https://gogosealsarizona.com/privacy-policy/"
  pageCss={['/css/blog.css?v=1']}
>
  <section class="post-hero">
    <div class="post-hero-inner">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="post-hero-meta"><span>Last updated: {updated}</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="post-layout">
    <article class="post-content">
      <p>Go Go Gloss LLC ("Go Go Gloss," "we," "us," or "our") provides paver sealing, epoxy floor coating, and related concrete coating services in the Phoenix, Arizona metro area. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and the choices you have. By using our website, submitting a quote request, or communicating with us, you agree to the practices described here.</p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p><strong>Information you give us.</strong> When you request a quote, book a service, fill out a form (including Facebook or Instagram lead forms), call, text, or email us, we may collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Name, phone number, and email address</li>
        <li>Property or service address, city, and ZIP code</li>
        <li>Details about your project, such as service type, preferred dates and times, photos, and notes</li>
        <li>Billing and payment details needed to complete a job (payments are processed by third-party payment processors; we do not store full card numbers)</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> When you visit our website, we and our analytics and advertising partners (such as Google Analytics and Meta) may collect device and usage information, including IP address, browser type, pages viewed, referring site, and time on site, using cookies, pixels, and similar technologies.</p>

      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to your inquiries and provide quotes and estimates</li>
        <li>Schedule, perform, and follow up on services</li>
        <li>Send appointment confirmations, reminders, job updates, and invoices</li>
        <li>Provide customer support</li>
        <li>Send promotional offers by email or text message, where you have opted in</li>
        <li>Improve our website, services, and advertising</li>
        <li>Comply with legal obligations and protect our rights</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>SMS / Text Messaging</h2>
      <p>If you provide your mobile number and check the consent box on our website or lead forms, or otherwise give us your consent, you agree to receive text messages from Go Go Gloss about your quote, appointments, service updates, customer care, and occasional promotional offers. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Consent to receive text messages is not a condition of purchase.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Reply <strong>STOP</strong> at any time to opt out. You will receive one final message confirming your opt-out.</li>
        <li>Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help, or contact us at <a href={`tel:${phoneRaw}`}>{phone}</a> or <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>.</li>
        <li>Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes. Text messaging originator opt-in data and consent will not be shared with any third parties.</strong> This excludes service providers that help us deliver text messages (such as our messaging platform and telecommunications carriers), which may only use this information to provide that service to us.</p>

      <h2>How We Share Information</h2>
      <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information. We share it only as follows:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Service providers</strong> that help us run our business, such as scheduling and CRM software, messaging and email platforms, payment processors, website hosting, and analytics providers. They may use your information only to perform services for us.</li>
        <li><strong>Legal requirements</strong>: when required by law, subpoena, or court order, or to protect the rights, property, or safety of Go Go Gloss, our customers, or others.</li>
        <li><strong>Business transfers</strong>: in connection with a merger, sale, or transfer of all or part of our business.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>All of the above is subject to the SMS restrictions in the section above. Mobile numbers and text messaging consent are never shared for third-party marketing.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and Advertising</h2>
      <p>We use cookies and tracking pixels to understand how visitors use our website and to measure and improve our advertising. You can block or delete cookies through your browser settings. You can opt out of Google Analytics with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>, and manage ad preferences in your Google and Facebook account settings.</p>

      <h2>Data Retention</h2>
      <p>We keep your information for as long as needed to provide services, maintain business and tax records, resolve disputes, and enforce our agreements. After that we delete or anonymize it.</p>

      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>We use reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to protect your information. No method of transmission or storage is 100% secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

      <h2>Your Choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Text messages:</strong> reply STOP to any message.</li>
        <li><strong>Emails:</strong> click "unsubscribe" in any marketing email.</li>
        <li><strong>Access, correction, or deletion:</strong> contact us using the information below and we will respond within a reasonable time.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>Our services are intended for adults. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe a child has given us information, contact us and we will delete it.</p>

      <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>Our website may link to other sites, such as social media or review platforms. We are not responsible for their privacy practices, so please review their policies.</p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes take effect when posted on this page, and the "Last updated" date above will change.</p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Go Go Gloss LLC</strong><br>
        Phoenix Metro, Arizona<br>
        Phone: <a href={`tel:${phoneRaw}`}>{phone}</a><br>
        Email: <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
